# Google Drive shortcut stubs. Not files — pointers to Docs living online.
# git cannot read them ("invalid argument") and one stub aborts the whole
# `git add`, so this line is load-bearing, not tidiness.
#
# This working tree lives under G:\My Drive, so any Doc created or dropped
# into the folder lands here as a stub. Convert such a Doc to real markdown
# (or a real asset) and commit that — never the stub.
*.gdoc
*.gsheet
*.gslides
*.gdraw
*.gform

# Google Drive partial-upload scratch files
.tmp.drive*
*.crdownload

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# This site is hand-written HTML/CSS served straight from the repo by GitHub
# Pages — there is no build step, so there is no build output to ignore and
# nothing here may be generated. If a toolchain is ever added, whatever it
# emits must be ignored explicitly; anything not ignored gets published.
